    "welcome.screen0.eyebrow": "Welcome to s&box",
    "welcome.screen0.title": "it's made of mods",
    "welcome.screen0.text_1": "In s&box <strong>everything is user created content</strong>. Games, maps, models, guns, npcs - all little addons.",
    "welcome.screen0.text_2": "Nothing to install or subscribe to. Click a game.. and <strong>it opens</strong>. Click a model.. and <strong>it spawns</strong>. Click an entity.. and <strong>it's there</strong>.",
    "welcome.screen0.text_3": "It's <strong>Workshop</strong> - but not as you know it.",
    "welcome.screen1.eyebrow": "Make Something",
    "welcome.screen1.title": "omg an editor",
    "welcome.screen1.text_1": "This isn't just a Source 2 mod - it's a modern game engine.",
    "welcome.screen1.text_2": "It's on your Steam under Tools, just search for <strong>s&box editor</strong>",
    "welcome.screen1.text_3": "If you've ever wanted to make a game, this is the easiest place to start.. or just have fun playing with the physics and particles!",
    "welcome.screen1.button": "Learn More at sbox.game/learn",
    "welcome.screen2.eyebrow": "every game is different",
    "welcome.screen2.title": "freedom",
    "welcome.screen2.text_1": "You won't always be a sausage, each game can decide what you play as.",
    "welcome.screen2.text_2": "Some use our shared characters, others use their own. We don't and won't restrict this in any way.",
    "welcome.screen2.text_3": "Buying skins is optional, when you do it supports the creators and the <strong>Play Fund</strong>. This isn't NFT or blockchain stuff. This is the same Steam Inventory from Rust, CS2 and Dota.",
    "welcome.screen3.eyebrow": "Get Started",
    "welcome.screen3.title": "Try one of these",
    "welcome.screen3.text_1": "Overwhelmed? These games will give you a taste of what s&box can do.",
